    "name": "intraday_two_sided_wick_absorption_balance_240m",
    "direction": "higher",
    "formula": "Across exactly 240 bars at 09:31-11:30 and 13:01-15:00, define lower wick l_i=log(min(open_i,close_i)/low_i) and upper wick u_i=log(high_i/max(open_i,close_i)). Pool L=sum(l_i) and U=sum(u_i) and return 2*min(L,U)/(L+U).",
